{
  "about": "The building level's inventory (docs/v2/borrow-and-spawn.md §6; the user, 2026-11-01): there are too many kinds of building in a universe to offer them all, so a building's name and the sentences round it in its scenes are searched against these types, and Jev chooses among the ten nearest, given the scenes. Each type: describe, what it is (what the search and Jev read), saying nothing of its height; words, what the text may call it (Chinese, Japanese, English); use, the coarse use its lot and its model go by (TERRAIN_KINDS.building, config/models.json); or shape, the basic shape it is (a tunnel a cut, a raised deck a platform), placed as a shape at the building level. Its height is the scenes' (the user, 2026-11-01): every building is offered the same slices, from under the street to a hundred floors, from its type's least floors up (heights.json), with any measure its sentences give. A type whose use has no lot where it stands is placed where the characters' travel is least and pushes the buildings round it outward.",
